id: cpc_ng_primary
package: cpc_ng
description: |
  This component implements the CPC-NG Primary (host) role. It provides
  primary-specific control-plane initialization and system management so this
  device can open endpoints and communicate with a CPC-NG Secondary. The
  physical link is selected by a CPC-NG Primary driver instance.

  This is the next-generation stack. It requires the CPC-NG core and is not
  compatible with the original "cpc" package.
category: Services|CPC-NG|Primary Device
quality: experimental
label: CPC-NG Primary Device
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
source:
- path: src/sli_cpc_control_primary.c
provides:
- name: cpc_ng_primary
requires:
- name: cpc_ng
- name: cpc_ng_primary_drv_instance
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: cpc_ng_primary
root_path: cpc_ng
